<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 6.18 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 6.18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.18 percent on Sunday from 4.32 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said nine banks traded on the market in 28 reported transactions with a total value of 24.75 million dinars ($35.0 million).</p>
<p>($1 = 0.7080 dinar)</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
